I'm happy to say that I think you have come up with the most complete implementation of a Chatbot to date. However, I have a few ideas to make the system better.

Firstly, the system that you have created is pretty much entirely self containing, without any external knowledge of the system. You, at the moment, are using the knowledge embedded within the system to define the response as "I agree.". To do that, you have created a very specific answer for each data point, and have been using the answer to make other decisions.

If you want to be a good chatbot system, the way I would do it, you would want to be more self contained. This means, being able to tell the system to guess an input based on the data within the system.

